{
  "id": "E134",
  "title": "This is My Friend",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2017-07-15",
  "synopsis": "How does Paul’s friend introduce him in Chinese?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/472/14616812debf34ae3e8592d74936bbfcbec44060.mp3?1499718661",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "这是我朋友\n\n    这是我朋友，他叫保罗。他是美国人，在上海学习汉语。他喜欢打乒乓球，还喜欢旅游。他很喜欢吃中国菜，也会做中国菜。",
    "traditional": "這是我朋友\n\n    這是我朋友，他叫保羅。他是美國人，在上海學習漢語。他喜歡打乒乓球，還喜歡旅遊。他很喜歡吃中國菜，也會做中國菜。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "This is my friend"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "这是我朋友，他叫保罗。",
      "traditional": "這是我朋友，他叫保羅。",
      "pinyin": "zhè shì wǒ péng you tā jiào bǎo luó",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "他是美国人，在上海学习汉语。",
      "traditional": "他是美國人，在上海學習漢語。",
      "pinyin": "tā shì měi guó rén zài shàng hǎi xué xí hàn yǔ",
      "english": "This is my friend and his name is Paul."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "他喜欢打乒乓球，还喜欢旅游。",
      "traditional": "他喜歡打乒乓球，還喜歡旅遊。",
      "pinyin": "tā xǐ huan dǎ pīng pāng qiú hái xǐ huan lǚ yóu",
      "english": "He is from the U.S. and studies Chinese in Shanghai."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "他很喜欢吃中国菜，也会做中国菜。",
      "traditional": "他很喜歡吃中國菜，也會做中國菜。",
      "pinyin": "tā hěn xǐ huan chī zhōng guó cài yě huì zuò zhōng guó cài",
      "english": "He likes to play ping-pong and travel."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "He very much likes to eat Chinese food. He can also make Chinese dishes."
    }
  ],
